## 9. Violations and how to fix them

If You break a condition of this License and ATEC notifies You in writing, Your rights continue if, within 30 days
of the notice, You stop the violation and take reasonable steps to correct its effects (for example removing paid
offers or adding the missing credit). If You do not, all Your rights under this License end. The first time You are
notified about a violation, Your rights are restored as soon as You comply, even after the 30 days. People who
received copies from You keep their rights as long as they comply themselves. Section 4 ends patent rights
separately.

